{"data": {"__GLOBAL": {"_ATTACH_BASE_VIEW": "img.nga.cn/attachments"}, "__U": {"150058": {"uid": 150058, "username": "UID:150058", "credit": 135537154, "medal": "272,207,157,92", "reputation": "28_30,61_0,147_775,130_10", "groupid": -1, "memberid": 73, "avatar": null, "yz": 4, "site": null, "honor": null, "regdate": 1123989606, "mute_time": null, "postnum": 42229, "rvrc": 29, "money": 90765, "thisvisit": 1788178932, "signature": null, "nickname": null, "bit_data": 135537154}, "__GROUPS": {"73": ["学徒", 360672, 73]}, "__MEDALS": {"272": ["272.gif", "棒棒糖", "叔叔请你吃棒棒糖", 272], "207": ["207.gif", "爆竹声中旧岁除", "一支红杏出墙来", 207], "157": ["157.gif", "王者之剑", "王者之剑活动纪念", 157], "92": ["92.gif", "小心死亡之翼-", "2011年大灾变开服纪念", 92]}, "__REPUTATIONS": {"147": {"150058": 775, "0": "大时代"}}}, "__R": [{"pid": 878308649, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 48, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-13 14:20", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=878308248,47288722,734]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67285134]野比大次郎二号机[/uid] (2026-08-13 14:17):[/b]<br/><br/>狼兄这个3-5个点的ETF做T幅度是指日内做T的幅度还是隔日t的幅度阿，日内今天铁盒上下幅度1.30%左右，我好奇怎么可以t到3-5%，应该是算做天的吧[s:a2:偷吃][/quote]<br/>肯定按一买和一卖啊  <br/>昨天买了到今天高点附近  还是2次高点附近 不都是3个点吗<br/>刚才又T入进去  又等下一个3-5个点的机会啊。如果再起来了  是不是比昨天买的不动的多吃了3个点？<br/>我还利用这笔钱早上操作了一波  也发这里了  是不是等于多了5个点以上？<br/>相当于这笔钱的利用率我再买回来的时候 已经比昨天买的不动的多吃了5个点以上了。<br/><br/>单指这笔钱   那些底仓不动的  没底仓就做不了T。", "lou": 280, "content_length": 339, "reply_to": 878308248, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1786602031}, {"pid": 878309809, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 71, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-13 14:31", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "反正下半场没什么太好操作的行情<br/>买回去半导体也是为了保证我有T的空间和仓位  最主要是不干点什么我就睡着了。<br/>整体行情就是临近3995-4020在各种博弈<br/>反正大家目标都是反弹 那就没人主动做持续性<br/>然后关注GJD会不会把之前兜底的科技又开始做T减出去。", "lou": 281, "content_length": 226, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1786602669}, {"pid": 878310620, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 37, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-13 14:37", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=878310274,47288722,738]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67285134]野比大次郎二号机[/uid] (2026-08-13 14:34):[/b]<br/><br/>狼兄的机器人仓位还是早上的仓位不动吗[/quote]<br/>T+1的  动不了", "lou": 282, "content_length": 16, "reply_to": 878310274, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1786603063}, {"pid": 878311219, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 67, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-13 14:42", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=878311013,47288722,741]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=36979556]费曼先生[/uid] (2026-08-13 14:40):[/b]<br/><br/>这走势把狼大都骗了，以为指数安全呢[/quote]<br/>指数是安全的啊。。。放了3000E的量就这点波动。。。。不算什么了。", "lou": 283, "content_length": 68, "reply_to": 878311013, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1786603348}, {"pid": 878311657, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 106, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-13 14:46", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "你们这样迟早自己能把自己吓死的", "lou": 284, "content_length": 30, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1786603571}, {"pid": 878312257, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 136, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-13 14:51", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "昨晚你们还在说  再不买就买不到啦  要起飞啦<br/>现在就看要结束啦？<br/>一个小震荡罢了。<br/>些许波动<br/>甚至不算风霜。", "lou": 285, "content_length": 94, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1786603869}, {"pid": 878312594, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 46, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-13 14:53", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=878312287,47288722,745]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=41640741]飚车小能手[/uid] (2026-08-13 14:51):[/b]<br/><br/>狼大，前两天是缩量涨，今天放量跌，还是认为下周会稍微向下一段就再上去挑战缺口吗[s:a2:不明觉厉][/quote]<br/>小级别的上升ABC。。。现在不就是第一波测试4000附近后走B么  下午不是说了么", "lou": 286, "content_length": 75, "reply_to": 878312287, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1786604031}, {"pid": 878313013, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 76, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-13 14:57", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=878312484,47288722,745]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67157410]c471167449[/uid] (2026-08-13 14:52):[/b]<br/><br/>我也不太懂，7月吃了-30到-50最多哀嚎，也没恐慌，现在-3到-5感觉恐慌盘都出来了，感觉这个心理学上是创伤后遗症么。。。[s:ac:哭笑][/quote]<br/>我不知道你们<br/>对于我来说  我昨天只是小加了一笔  然后做了个T  <br/>也就是我昨天加的根本不够 因为不到位置  哪怕刚才跳了也没到我的第二加法点<br/>都不够幅度。<br/>如果今晚老美能差一点  明天开盘来个-5% 那就很有性价比了<br/>不然三天都在3个点内的波动  做T都难做。", "lou": 287, "content_length": 225, "reply_to": 878312484, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1786604232}, {"pid": 878314213, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 71, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-13 15:06", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=878313725,47288722,748]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=65768926]好好看好好学不好[/uid] (2026-08-13 15:03):[/b]<br/><br/>前两天那种缩量乱拉今天大概率要砸了，问题是大资金是怎么达成共识的，早上甚至直到 2点前还有资金进，2 点后卖盘就涌出来了，，[/quote]<br/>不用达成共识<br/>第一波接近高点多次突破不过去就已经说明问题了<br/>一旦回落  反手就可以兑现的。", "lou": 288, "content_length": 87, "reply_to": 878313725, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1786604791}, {"pid": 878405544, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 112, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-14 11:30", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "小级别的ABC的B不出意外的探到了3900附近", "lou": 289, "content_length": 38, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1786678200}, {"pid": 878406214, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 172, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-14 11:35", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=878405911,47288722,803]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67142257]兰斯洛t[/uid] (2026-08-14 11:32):[/b]<br/><br/>狼的判断是下午杀不出来就不杀了吗？[/quote]<br/>我感觉你们已经把我的善意当成理所当然了。", "lou": 290, "content_length": 45, "reply_to": 878405911, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1786678515}, {"pid": 878409116, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 61, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-14 11:56", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=878408516,47288722,806]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=60239810]炒面加蛋[/uid] (2026-08-14 11:51):[/b]<br/><br/>狼大，cpo好像最近还行，中际旭创还是机构首选吗[s:a2:恨][/quote]<br/>你真的觉得中继反弹了嘛？对比别的方向。", "lou": 291, "content_length": 43, "reply_to": 878408516, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1786679781}, {"pid": 878420609, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 143, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-14 13:41", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "截至目前 我的仓位一半已经调入了国算方向。<br/>另外一半是半导体ETF和短线仓位。<br/>这是下半年的思路。", "lou": 292, "content_length": 89, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1786686092}, {"pid": 878420984, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 188, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-14 13:44", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "你们别管我在哪个  我不想和你们同车  还要当保姆给你们喂奶<br/>哪天没奶了还骂娘的。", "lou": 293, "content_length": 72, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1786686278}, {"pid": 878421216, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 52, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-14 13:46", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=878420812,47288722,817]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=1704189]坏蛋桃白白[/uid] (2026-08-14 13:43):[/b]<br/><br/>狼大是否还觉得海外链现在为止无论大光还是pcb都是在用国外的利好出货[/quote]<br/>对的 我目前对海外连的看法没有任何变化。", "lou": 294, "content_length": 43, "reply_to": 878420812, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1786686395}, {"pid": 878422578, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 58, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-14 13:58", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=878422418,47288722,820]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67273693]小土豆二号机[/uid] (2026-08-14 13:57):[/b]<br/><br/>下半年是国算和材料吧，我目前3:1的配比，等国算上去了材料也差不多了，到时候1:1配[/quote]<br/>目前我也是这么操作。材料目前就用ETF代替。", "lou": 295, "content_length": 46, "reply_to": 878422418, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1786687134}, {"pid": 878424050, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 89, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-14 14:10", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "目前探底第一次 还是缩量 没放量那就问题不大<br/>先看看今天能不能算止跌吧。", "lou": 296, "content_length": 66, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1786687832}, {"pid": 878424388, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 51, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-14 14:13", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=878424226,47288722,824]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67298618]大浪桃莎[/uid] (2026-08-14 14:11):[/b]<br/><br/>狼总  国算有什么推荐的etf吗[/quote]<br/>目前没发现", "lou": 297, "content_length": 15, "reply_to": 878424226, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1786687996}, {"pid": 878424597, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 118, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-14 14:14", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=878424374,47288722,824]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=66547048]国标新人[/uid] (2026-08-14 14:13):[/b]<br/><br/>无人在意的角落<br/>北部湾港跌停。[/quote]<br/>不要看那个 有人做局收尾 本地人给你的忠告。", "lou": 298, "content_length": 45, "reply_to": 878424374, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1786688099}, {"pid": 878424901, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 27, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-14 14:17", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=878424613,47288722,824]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67241955]难难难道最玄[/uid] (2026-08-14 14